{"accountName": "美丽联合集团安全应急响应中心", "author": "美丽联合集团安全应急响应中心", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "2019-11-05 10:00", "type": "p"}, {"text": "正义白帽，公益挖洞！", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/GCoSP6cMib6XX1JPeXtexLiaJYOXKD8KbYoVJRaNYSmGYOdQ9gicQLRmib3luiczTAibaQ6wNZZvfGCM5HYubd70LFGQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "白帽极客节", "type": "p"}, {"text": "10月17日(国际消除贫苦日)", "type": "p"}, {"text": "-10月24日(程序员节)", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/tCS9QJPdcGdXTTOYYm1DEWxMKhfOwbQp9clPIEzfqMvhqibADPdkaCDPhibibqWPbjggrEF3SUuZZmZT6kjSMbcsA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "由阿里公益与阿里巴巴、蚂蚁金服、爱奇艺、滴滴、快手、美丽联合、苏宁、微博、小米、携程、猪八戒、字节跳动、360，13家企业的安全响应中心（SRC）联合发起了 白帽极客节。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "白帽极客节的第一年，我们用正义白帽，公益挖洞的方式，共同帮助来自贫困地区的孩子们。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "活动期间, 来自世界各地多个国家", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/tCS9QJPdcGdSranaW4icIIT0Uh5BO0Xgg2n10LCZkPjtePjdiavIWiaHSGR0EuKh0JqcbBsonVyjYUNOusrFw55yQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "247名白帽子", "type": "p"}, {"text": "提交了 688 个漏洞报告", "type": "p"}, {"text": "阿里巴巴、滴滴、快手、美丽联合", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/tCS9QJPdcGdSranaW4icIIT0Uh5BO0Xggz3IAnic4CeWa8xWR1icL8icibfibwMSicBLMVY3t8A5Xb0ZkcHcTALltu6Jg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "微博、携程、猪八戒", "type": "p"}, {"text": "7家企业的SRC，", "type": "p"}, {"text": "淘宝公益店铺以及微公益平台", "type": "p"}, {"text": "总计捐出善款 156129.27  元", "type": "p"}, {"text": "所筹善款将支持 31 所贫困地区学校 的", "type": "p"}, {"text": "体育设施与设备援助", "type": "p"}, {"text": "让孩子们可以享受体育运动带来的快乐", "type": "p"}, {"text": "此次捐助的学校主要集中在 贵州黎平 和 青海玉树 地区", "type": "p"}, {"text": "蚂蚁金服、爱奇艺、苏宁", "type": "p"}, {"text": "小米、字节跳动、360", "type": "p"}, {"text": "6家企业的SRC，", "type": "p"}, {"text": "捐出 500个书包、1500个笔记本、300个笔袋", "type": "p"}, {"text": "音响、保温杯、帽子、彩笔、书籍若干", "type": "p"}, {"text": "活动开启后也收到了社会各界的关注", "type": "p"}, {"text": "人民日报海外版、 中国新闻周刊、北京商报、", "type": "p"}, {"text": "科技日报、 爱德基金会、阿里巴巴公益", "type": "p"}, {"text": "安全客、 安全牛 、 安在、", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Freebuf  、 华盟网、 看雪、 MottoIN、", "type": "p"}, {"text": "铁匠运维网、 嘶吼、 指尖安全 、", "type": "p"}, {"text": "等国内外媒体 均进行了 报道", "type": "p"}, {"text": "有超过 1000多万人次 通过报道了解此次活动", "type": "p"}, {"text": "有超过 120多万人次 观看了活动视频", "type": "p"}, {"text": "致谢名单", "type": "p"}, {"text": "谢谢所有为这次活动做出贡献的组织和伙伴们", "type": "p"}, {"text": "请收下来自联合主办方的感谢", "type": "p"}, {"text": "一起来看这份有温度的致谢名单", "type": "p"}, {"text": "排名不分先后，以A-Z顺序排列，名单可上下滑动", "type": "p"}, {"text": "❤️感谢在活动中向", "type": "p"}, {"text": "ASRC, CSRC, DSRC,", "type": "p"}, {"text": "KwaiSRC, MLSRC, WSRC, ZSRC提交有效漏洞报告的白帽子", "type": "p"}, {"text": "❤️对应SRC将以你们的名义向贫困学校捐出善款", "type": "p"}, {"text": "❤️你们将会得到由阿里巴巴公益和爱德基金会认证的公益证书，", "type": "p"}, {"text": "证书将会在本月邮寄，有疑问请邮件咨询security@service.alibaba.com", "type": "p"}, {"text": "__ 画船听雨", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0h1in9e", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0h1in9e22", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2hFen9", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2u0y0u", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Art3mis", "type": "p"}, {"text": "ASRC_ADMIN", "type": "p"}, {"text": "AtlantisQuQ", "type": "p"}, {"text": "A 乃", "type": "p"}, {"text": "dozybrit", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Dr.Thril", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Drea1v1", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Dr-Thril", "type": "p"}, {"text": "fengwuhuilu88", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Fsname", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Funhity", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Funnysec 养狐人", "type": "p"}, {"text": "FYX", "type": "p"}, {"text": "gdygdy", "type": "p"}, {"text": "janthraper", "type": "p"}, {"text": "joinmouse", "type": "p"}, {"text": "knight&quot", "type": "p"}, {"text": "l024", "type": "p"}, {"text": "lakes", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Mat", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Max 老白 Gan", "type": "p"}, {"text": "mile", "type": "p"}, {"text": "NeelPonkia.Jensec.Cuso4", "type": "p"}, {"text": "nopeople", "type": "p"}, {"text": "nullsaint", "type": "p"}, {"text": "open_96b5_5dvb", "type": "p"